  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian support as a response to Flash Appeal March 2011. Financing to Islamic Relief Sweden in order to primarily attend to people in need in the boarder with Lybia and Tunisia. The Flash Appeal has also received funding through UNHCR and UNICEF through other agreement.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Humanit&#xE4;rt st&#xF6;d som svar p&#xE5; FNs blixtappell mars 2011. Finansiering till Islamic Relief Sverige f&#xF6;r att i f&#xF6;rsta hand ta hand om beh&#xF6;vande vid gr&#xE4;nsen mellan Libyen och Tunisia.  Blixtappellen f&#xE5;r &#xE4;ven st&#xF6;d till UNHCR och UNICEF via annat avtal.</narrative>
